      giveStarterFood: 1
      giveFirstBoots: 0
      giveCoins: 0
    - name: Deeper
      reachedBy: 2
      toast: "\U0001F97E Some old walking boots by the ladder. Now you can roll (Space / B). The Smithy and Workshop will open at camp."
